{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36481","headline":"秋日留题蒋亭 · 罗邺","name":"秋日留题蒋亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西风才起一蝉鸣，便筭关河马上程。\n碧浪鷁舟从此别，丹霄鹄箭忍无成。\n二年芳思随云雨，几日离歌恋斾旌。\n回首横塘更东望，露荷烟菊倍伤情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36481.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36481","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}